@shop_token=515533758a5de11f8e4312092dd97b3e1f5a933323488d8673e9052b7d47ef6e
# ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

# 常用 GraphQL mutation 示例（VS Code REST Client 格式）
# Created	已创建	初始状态，订单刚生成
# AddingItems	添加商品中	用户正在购物车中添加商品
# ArrangingPayment	正在安排付款	用户已提交订单，准备付款
# （Stripe 要求此状态）
# PaymentAuthorized	已授权付款	某些支付方式会先授权再扣款
# PaymentSettled	已结算付款	Stripe webhook 通知付款成功后自动进入此状态
# Shipped	已发货	商家已发货
# Delivered	已送达	用户已收到商品
# Cancelled	已取消	用户或商家取消订单

###

1️⃣ 查询订单状态 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ OK OK OK  
http
### 查询订单状态 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ OK OK OK  
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{shop_token}}

{
  "query": "query GetOrder($code: String!) { orderByCode(code: $code) { id code state } }",
  "variables": {
    "code": "M9ZZH698ZS2FF7JJ"
  }
}

###


2️⃣ 转换订单状态为 ArrangingPayment
http
### 转换订单状态为 ArrangingPayment  / AddingItems / PaymentSettled
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{shop_token}}

{
  "query": "mutation TransitionOrder($state: String!) { transitionOrderToState(state: $state) { ... on Order { id code state } ... on OrderStateTransitionError { message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "state": "PaymentSettled"
  }
}

###


3️⃣ 创建 Stripe PaymentIntent（Vendure 插件）
http
### 创建 Stripe PaymentIntent
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CreateIntent { createStripePaymentIntent { ... on StripePaymentIntent { clientSecret } ... on ErrorResult { message } } }"
}
4️⃣ 手动结算付款（仅用于非 Stripe 流程）
http
### 手动结算付款（非 Stripe）
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation SettlePayment($id: ID!) { settlePayment(paymentId: $id) { ... on Payment { id state } ... on ErrorResult { message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": "PAYMENT_ID_HERE"
  }
}
5️⃣ 发货订单
http
### 发货订单
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation TransitionOrder($state: String!) { transitionOrderToState(state: $state) { ... on Order { id code state } ... on OrderStateTransitionError { message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "state": "Shipped"
  }
}
6️⃣ 取消订单
http
### 取消订单
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CancelOrder { cancelOrder { ... on Order { id code state } ... on ErrorResult { message } } }"
}
